            <button type="button" class="rounded-md bg-indigo-600 px-5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-sm hover:bg-indigo-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-300" data-fg-step-next="ks_wizard">Next</button>
